    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is i dont want to \"reach out\" to people. they're the ones who did this. there's no \"fixing\" it. once everyone decides you're the bad guy, you're just... done. it's like i'm already dead to them. there's no point in trying to rebuild when the foundation is just gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
