    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how do you build something new when you're essentially a pariah? i can't just start over from nothing. it's not just about \"new friends,\" it's that the version of me that lived here, had a life, is dead. there's no way to exist in a world where you've been completely cast out. it just feels like there's no place left for me to actually be.",
